    title: "Trump envoys met Qatari officials in Berlin to discuss US-Iran mediation, report says",
    summary: "Trump envoys met Qatari officials in Berlin to discuss US-Iran mediation, report says US President Donald Trump’s envoys Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner met senior Qatari officials in Berlin on Thursday to discuss mediation efforts between the US and Iran , Axios reported on Friday, citing two sources with knowledge of the meeting. The meeting came as Qatar’s Emir Sheikh Tamim bin Hamad Al Thani was in Germany on a visit. Following talks with German Chancellor Friedrich Merz in Berlin, the emir called for diplomatic efforts to de-escalate conflicts across the Middle East. On the sidelines of the visit, Qatari Foreign Minister Sheikh Mohammed bin Abdulrahman bin Jassim Al Thani met his German counterpart Johann Wadephul. The two discussed ongoing diplomatic efforts and joint coordination to de-escalate tensions and enhance security and stability in the region, according to the Qatari foreign ministry.",
