    title: "'Iranians are after me': US Treasury secretary says he lives on a military base",
    summary: "'Iranians are after me': US Treasury secretary says he lives on a military base US Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent said on Friday that he was still living on a US military base after receiving unspecified threats from Iran, but vowed to keep squeezing the country economically. \"The Iranians are after me. I'm not going to be cowered by the Iranians. Life on the military base is good,\" Bessent said in an interview with CNBC. \"If the Iranians are after me, it means that they are being squeezed. We're going to continue squeezing them,\" he added. The US Treasury has been tightening sanctions on Iran since the US and Israel launched strikes on the country in February. \"Operation Economic Outcast, which we are two and a half months into, is the greatest economic isolation of any country in history,\" Bessent said. \"For the first time in history since Iran started producing oil, they have no oil on the water, so there is no crude for anyone to buy. No Iranian crude for anyone to buy.\" ⚡️JUST IN: U.S. Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent says he enjoys his life at the Military Base \"The Iranians are after me. I'm not going to be cowered by the Iranians. Life on the military base is good\" https://t.co/ISrwB1VnQD — Iran Observer (@IranObserver0) November 20, 2026",
